argin:0;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none;\"></figure></div><h2>Why Homeowners Choose The Proud Paintbrush</h2><p>Our portfolio is more than a gallery—it’s proof of a process that prioritizes preparation, professionalism, and clear communication.</p><p>Homeowners choose us for:</p><ul><li><p>Consistent, detail-oriented prep work</p></li><li><p>Experienced crews who respect the home</p></li><li><p>Clear expectations and clean timelines</p></li></ul><p>Many of the projects you see here come from repeat clients and referrals.</p><a href=\"https://theproudpaintbrush.youcanbook.me\"> Schedule Your Free Estimate </a><h2>Learn More About Our Work</h2><p>If you’d like more detail about specific services or what to expect during a project, you can explore:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/painting-services\"><strong>Painting Services</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/testimonials\"><strong>Testimonials</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/faq\"><strong>FAQs</strong></a></p></li></ul><h2>Portfolio FAQs</h2><p><strong>What types of projects are shown in your painting portfolio?</strong><br> Our portfolio includes interior painting, exterior painting, cabinet painting, and specialty projects completed for residential and select commercial clients.</p><p><strong>Do you have before-and-after photos?</strong><br> Yes. Many portfolio entries include before-and-after images to show the full transformation.</p><p><strong>Can I request references from past projects?</strong><br> Yes. We’re happy to connect prospective clients with past customers who can share their experience.</p><p><strong>How often is the portfolio updated?</strong><br> New projects are added regularly to reflect recent work and evolving styles.</p><a href=\"https://theproudpaintbrush.youcanbook.me\"> Schedule Your Free Estimate </a><h2>Hear From Our Customers</h2><p>See what working with The Proud Paintbrush is really like — straight from local homeowners.</p><div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:1.5rem auto;\"><div sty